<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Vraj Modi — Web Developer & Computer Engineering Student</title>
<meta name="description" content="Portfolio of Vraj Modi — web developer and computer engineering student in Ahmedabad, building premium, visually rich websites.">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="dark">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter+Tight:wght@600;700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<noscript><style>#loader{display:none!important}.line>span{transform:none!important}.rv{opacity:1!important;transform:none!important}</style></noscript>
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#04060a;
  --ink:#f4f5f7;
  --dim:#9096a3;
  --faint:#5c626f;
  --line:rgba(255,255,255,.1);
  --blue:#2f9bff;
  --pink:#c07fd0;
  --red:#ff3b5c;
  --grad:linear-gradient(90deg,#2f9bff 0%,#c07fd0 55%,#ff3b5c 100%);
  --display:"Inter Tight","Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;
  --body:"Inter",system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;
  --mono:"JetBrains Mono",ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;
  box-sizing:border-box;
  padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);
  padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px);
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){
  :root:not([data-theme="light"]){--bg:#04060a;--ink:#f4f5f7;--dim:#9096a3;--faint:#5c626f;--line:rgba(255,255,255,.1);}
}
:root[data-theme="dark"]{--bg:#04060a;--ink:#f4f5f7;--dim:#9096a3;--faint:#5c626f;--line:rgba(255,255,255,.1);}

*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:calc(env(safe-area-inset-top,0px) + 70px);-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--body);font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;overflow-x:hidden}
body::before{content:"";position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:-2;pointer-events:none;
  background:
   radial-gradient(70vmax 55vmax at 68% 42%,rgba(22,62,110,.30),transparent 62%),
   radial-gradient(40vmax 40vmax at 0% 100%,rgba(20,40,90,.22),transparent 60%),
   var(--bg)}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
img{max-width:100%;display:block}
button{font:inherit;color:inherit}
:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--blue);outline-offset:3px;border-radius:4px}
::selection{background:var(--blue);color:#000}
.wrap{width:min(1320px,100% - clamp(40px,8vw,120px));margin-inline:auto}
.mono{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim);font-weight:400}
.grad{background:var(--grad);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent}

#net{position:fixed;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;z-index:-1;pointer-events:none}

/* custom cursor (fine pointers only) */
.cur,.cur-dot{position:fixed;left:0;top:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:200;border-radius:50%;opacity:0;transition:opacity .3s,width .25s,height .25s,background .25s}
.cur{width:16px;height:16px;margin:-8px 0 0 -8px;background:#f6e6dc}
.cur-dot{width:7px;height:7px;margin:-3.5px 0 0 -3.5px;background:var(--blue);z-index:201}
.cur.big{width:54px;height:54px;margin:-27px 0 0 -27px;background:rgba(246,230,220,.9);mix-blend-mode:difference}
@media (hover:hover) and (pointer:fine){
  body.has-cur,body.has-cur a,body.has-cur button{cursor:none}
  body.has-cur input,body.has-cur textarea{cursor:text}
  body.has-cur .cur,body.has-cur .cur-dot{opacity:1}
}

/* loader */
#loader{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:300;background:var(--bg);display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;padding:clamp(24px,4vw,48px);transition:transform .9s cubic-bezier(.76,0,.24,1)}
#loader.done{transform:translateY(-101%)}
#loader .top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between}
#loader .count{font:800 clamp(5rem,20vw,16rem)/.8 var(--display);letter-spacing:-.05em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
#loader .bar{position:absolute;left:0;bottom:0;height:3px;width:0;background:var(--grad)}

/* nav */
.nav{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:90;padding:calc(env(safe-area-inset-top,0px) + 18px) clamp(20px,4vw,56px) 0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;pointer-events:none}
.nav>*{pointer-events:auto}
.logo{font:800 1.35rem var(--display);letter-spacing:-.04em}
.logo i{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}
.nav ul{display:flex;gap:clamp(20px,3.2vw,48px);list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
.nav ul a{font:400 .72rem var(--mono);letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim);transition:color .2s}
.nav ul a:hover{color:var(--ink)}
.pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:14px 26px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);background:rgba(4,6,10,.4);font:500 .72rem var(--mono);letter-spacing:.28em;text-transform:uppercase;transition:background .25s,color .25s,border-color .25s;-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(10px);backdrop-filter:blur(10px)}
.pill:hover{background:var(--ink);color:#000;border-color:var(--ink)}
.pill.solid{background:var(--ink);color:#000;border-color:var(--ink)}
.pill.solid:hover{background:transparent;color:var(--ink)}
.nav .pill{padding:12px 24px}
@media (max-width:900px){.nav ul{display:none}}

/* hero */
.hero{position:relative;min-height:100svh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;padding:calc(env(safe-area-inset-top,0px) + 96px) clamp(20px,4vw,56px) clamp(28px,4vw,56px);overflow:hidden}
.hero .meta-l{display:grid;gap:8px}
.hero .meta-r{position:absolute;right:clamp(20px,4vw,56px);top:calc(env(safe-area-inset-top,0px) + 168px);text-align:right;display:grid;gap:8px;z-index:3}
.dot-live{display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#22c55e;margin-right:10px;box-shadow:0 0 10px #22c55e;vertical-align:middle}
#scene{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;z-index:0;pointer-events:none}
.portrait{position:absolute;right:clamp(20px,8vw,150px);top:57%;width:min(27vw,350px);z-index:2;margin:0;opacity:0;transform:translateY(-42%) rotate(2deg);transition:opacity 1.2s .4s,transform 1.4s .4s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}
.ready .portrait{opacity:1;transform:translateY(-50%) rotate(2deg)}
.portrait .frame{padding:10px;border-radius:34px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,rgba(255,255,255,.11),rgba(255,255,255,.03));border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);box-shadow:0 40px 80px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.85),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.18);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(20px);backdrop-filter:blur(20px)}
.portrait img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:3/4;object-fit:cover;border-radius:26px}
.portrait .tag{position:absolute;left:-28px;bottom:34px;padding:11px 18px;border-radius:16px;background:rgba(10,14,28,.74);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);font-size:.86rem;line-height:1.4;-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(16px);backdrop-filter:blur(16px)}
.portrait .tag strong{display:block;font:600 .95rem var(--body)}
.portrait .tag span{color:var(--dim)}
h1.name{position:relative;z-index:2;margin:0;font:800 clamp(5.2rem,14vw,15.5rem)/.86 var(--display);letter-spacing:-.05em;text-transform:uppercase}
.line{display:block;overflow:hidden;padding:.02em 0 .06em}
.line>span{display:block;transform:translateY(108%);transition:transform 1.2s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}
.ready .line>span{transform:none}
.ready .line:nth-child(2)>span{transition-delay:.12s}
.line>span.grad{display:inline-block;padding-right:.04em}
.intro{position:relative;z-index:3;max-width:30rem}
.intro .lab{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;margin-bottom:14px}
.intro .lab::before{content:"";width:44px;height:1px;background:var(--faint)}
.intro p{text-shadow:0 2px 18px rgba(4,6,10,.95);margin:0 0 26px;font-size:clamp(1.05rem,1.55vw,1.4rem);line-height:1.5;color:#dfe2e8}
.intro .row{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.hero .fade-in{opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px);transition:opacity 1s .7s,transform 1s .7s}
.ready .hero .fade-in{opacity:1;transform:none}
.star{position:absolute;right:16%;bottom:8%;width:38px;height:38px;z-index:3;color:#6fb0e8;animation:spin 9s linear infinite}
@keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}
@media (max-width:1100px) and (min-width:901px){.portrait{width:30vw;right:5vw}}
@media (max-width:900px){
  .hero .meta-r{top:auto;bottom:auto;position:static;text-align:left;order:9;margin-top:26px}
  .hero{padding-top:calc(env(safe-area-inset-top,0px) + 88px)}
  .portrait{right:6vw;top:calc(env(safe-area-inset-top,0px) + 132px);width:52vw;transform:rotate(2deg) translateY(20px)}
  .ready .portrait{transform:rotate(2deg)}
  .portrait .tag{left:-14px;bottom:20px;padding:9px 14px;font-size:.78rem}
  .namewrap{margin-top:76vw}
  .star{display:none}
  h1.name{margin-top:8px}
  .intro{max-width:100%}
  .intro p{text-shadow:0 2px 20px rgba(4,6,10,.9)}
}

/* marquee */
.marquee{border-block:1px solid var(--line);overflow:hidden;padding:26px 0;background:rgba(255,255,255,.015)}
.track{display:flex;width:max-content;animation:slide 40s linear infinite}
.marquee:hover .track{animation-play-state:paused}
.marquee span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:clamp(22px,3vw,44px);padding-right:clamp(22px,3vw,44px);font:700 clamp(1.4rem,3vw,2.6rem) var(--display);letter-spacing:-.03em;text-transform:none;white-space:nowrap}
.marquee span::after{content:"✦";font-size:.7em;color:var(--blue)}
@keyframes slide{to{transform:translateX(-50%)}}

/* sections */
section.blk{padding:clamp(90px,13vw,190px) 0}
.sec-lab{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;margin-bottom:28px}
.sec-lab::before{content:"";width:44px;height:1px;background:var(--faint)}
h2{margin:0;font:800 clamp(2.4rem,5.6vw,5rem)/1.02 var(--display);letter-spacing:-.045em}
.lead{margin:22px 0 0;max-width:38rem;color:var(--dim);font-size:1.1rem}

/* about */
.about{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.25fr .75fr;gap:clamp(40px,7vw,120px);align-items:start}
.about .txt p{margin:26px 0 0;max-width:36rem;color:var(--dim);font-size:1.12rem}
.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-left:1px solid var(--line)}
.stat{padding:clamp(22px,3vw,40px);border-right:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.stat b{display:block;font:800 clamp(2.6rem,5vw,4.4rem)/1 var(--display);letter-spacing:-.05em}
.stat span{display:block;margin-top:12px}
@media (max-width:900px){.about{grid-template-columns:1fr}}

/* toolkit */
.tk{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:clamp(30px,6vw,100px);align-items:center}
.tk-canvas{position:relative;width:100%;max-width:640px;aspect-ratio:1;margin-inline:auto;touch-action:pan-y}
.tk-canvas canvas{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;cursor:grab}
.tk-canvas canvas:active{cursor:grabbing}
.tk-meta{display:grid;gap:10px;margin-top:34px}
.tk-btn{margin-top:26px}
.stack{display:grid;grid-template-rows:0fr;transition:grid-template-rows .6s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}
.stack.open{grid-template-rows:1fr}
.stack>div{overflow:hidden}
.stack-inner{display:grid;gap:22px;padding-top:34px}
.stack h3{margin:0 0 10px;font:400 .72rem var(--mono);letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim)}
.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none}
.chip{padding:8px 16px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--line);font-size:.92rem;background:rgba(255,255,255,.03)}
@media (max-width:900px){.tk{grid-template-columns:1fr}}

/* work */
.wk-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;padding:16px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.row-p{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:72px 1fr minmax(180px,240px);gap:clamp(16px,3vw,48px);padding:clamp(28px,3.4vw,48px) 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);transition:background .35s,padding .35s}
.row-p:hover{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(47,155,255,.06),transparent 70%);padding-left:16px}
.row-p .n{font:400 .8rem var(--mono);letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--faint);padding-top:.8em}
.row-p h3{margin:0 0 12px;font:800 clamp(1.8rem,3.6vw,3.2rem)/1.05 var(--display);letter-spacing:-.04em}
.row-p p{margin:0 0 18px;max-width:40rem;color:var(--dim);font-size:1.02rem}
.row-p .chips{gap:6px}
.row-p .chip{padding:5px 12px;font:400 .7rem var(--mono);letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim)}
.st{display:grid;gap:14px;align-content:start;justify-items:end;text-align:right;padding-top:.6em}
.st a{display:inline-flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;font:500 .72rem var(--mono);letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;border-bottom:1px solid var(--faint);padding-bottom:4px;transition:color .2s,border-color .2s}
.st a:hover{color:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue)}
.tag-st{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.tag-st::before{content:"";width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue)}
@media (max-width:820px){
  .row-p{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .row-p .n{padding:0}
  .st{justify-items:start;text-align:left;padding:0}
  .row-p:hover{padding-left:0}
  .wk-head{display:none}
}

/* recognition */
.rec-lab{margin:clamp(40px,6vw,72px) 0 18px}
.rec-lab:first-of-type{margin-top:clamp(36px,5vw,60px)}
.rec{border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);border-radius:clamp(22px,3vw,34px);overflow:hidden;background:rgba(0,0,0,.4);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(6px);backdrop-filter:blur(6px)}
.rrow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:130px 1.25fr 1.15fr 190px;gap:clamp(18px,3vw,48px);align-items:center;padding:clamp(26px,3.2vw,44px) clamp(24px,3.6vw,52px);border-top:1px solid var(--line);transition:background .3s}
.rrow:first-child{border-top:0}
.rrow:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.025)}
.rrow .yr{font:400 .8rem var(--mono);letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim)}
.rrow h3{margin:0;font:700 clamp(1.4rem,2.3vw,2.1rem)/1.12 var(--display);letter-spacing:-.035em}
.rrow .role{margin:8px 0 0;color:var(--dim);font-size:1rem}
.rrow .desc{margin:0;color:#c9cdd6;font-size:.98rem;line-height:1.55;max-width:26rem}
.rrow .desc a{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;font:500 .68rem var(--mono);letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim);border-bottom:1px solid var(--faint);padding-bottom:3px;transition:color .2s,border-color .2s}
.rrow .desc a:hover{color:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue)}
.rrow .res{justify-self:end;text-align:right;font:700 clamp(1.5rem,2.4vw,2.2rem)/1 var(--display);letter-spacing:-.03em}
@media (max-width:980px){
  .rrow{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px}
  .rrow .res{justify-self:start;text-align:left;margin-top:6px}
  .rrow .desc{max-width:none}
  .rrow .desc:empty,.rrow .res:empty{display:none}
}

/* contact */
.big{font:800 clamp(3rem,10.4vw,9.6rem)/.9 var(--display);letter-spacing:-.055em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0}
.ct{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:clamp(36px,7vw,120px);margin-top:clamp(50px,7vw,100px);align-items:start}
.links{display:grid;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.links a{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:20px;padding:22px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);transition:padding .3s,color .3s}
.links a:hover{padding-left:12px;color:var(--blue)}
.links b{font:600 clamp(1rem,1.7vw,1.3rem) var(--display);letter-spacing:-.02em;word-break:break-all;text-align:right}
form{display:grid;gap:26px}
label{display:grid;gap:8px}
input,textarea{width:100%;padding:12px 0 14px;background:transparent;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22);color:var(--ink);font:400 1.05rem var(--body);border-radius:0}
input::placeholder,textarea::placeholder{color:var(--faint)}
input:focus,textarea:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--blue)}
textarea{min-height:110px;resize:vertical}
.note{margin:0;font-size:.85rem;color:var(--faint)}
@media (max-width:820px){.ct{grid-template-columns:1fr}}

footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:30px 0 calc(30px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px))}
footer .wrap{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}

/* reveal */
.js .rv{opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px);transition:opacity .9s,transform 1s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}
.js .rv.in{opacity:1;transform:none}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  html{scroll-behavior:auto}
  #loader{display:none}
  .line>span,.hero .fade-in,.portrait,.js .rv{transition:none;opacity:1;transform:none}
  .track,.star{animation:none}
  .portrait{transform:translateY(-50%) rotate(2deg)}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div id="loader" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="top"><span class="mono">Initializing experience</span><span class="mono">VM. / 2026</span></div>
  <div class="count" id="loadCount">000</div>
  <div class="bar" id="loadBar"></div>
</div>
<div class="cur" id="cur"></div><div class="cur-dot" id="curDot"></div>
<canvas id="net" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>

<header class="nav">
  <a class="logo" href="#top" aria-label="Vraj Modi, back to top">VM<i>.</i></a>
  <nav aria-label="Primary"><ul>
    <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
    <li><a href="#skills">Skills</a></li>
    <li><a href="#work">Work</a></li>
    <li><a href="#education">Recognition</a></li>
    <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
  </ul></nav>
  <a class="pill" href="#contact">Let's talk</a>
</header>

<main id="top">
  <section class="hero" aria-label="Introduction">
    <div class="meta-l"><span class="mono">Portfolio / 2026</span><span class="mono">Ahmedabad, IN</span></div>
    <div class="meta-r"><span class="mono"><i class="dot-live"></i>Available for freelance</span><span class="mono">Web · 3D · Front-end</span></div>

    <canvas id="scene" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
    <figure class="portrait"><div class="frame"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Vraj Modi working on his laptop" width="720" height="960"></div><figcaption class="tag"><strong>Ahmedabad, India</strong><span>B.E. Computer Science, batch of 2028</span></figcaption></figure>

    <div class="namewrap" style="position:relative;z-index:2">
      <h1 class="name" aria-label="Vraj Modi">
        <span class="line"><span>Vraj</span></span>
        <span class="line"><span class="grad">Modi</span></span>
      </h1>
    </div>

    <div class="intro fade-in">
      <div class="lab"><span class="mono">001 — Intro</span></div>
      <p>Web Developer · Computer Engineering Student · building premium, visually rich websites with glass surfaces, 3D scenes and scroll-driven motion.</p>
      <div class="row">
        <a class="pill" href="#work">View work <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a>
        <a class="pill solid" href="#contact">Contact <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <svg class="star" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 0c.6 6.4 5.6 11.4 12 12-6.4.6-11.4 5.6-12 12-.6-6.4-5.6-11.4-12-12C6.4 11.4 11.4 6.4 12 0z"/></svg>
  </section>

  <div class="marquee" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="track">
      <span>Web Developer</span><span>Front-end</span><span>Three.js</span><span>Glassmorphism</span><span>Scroll Effects</span><span>Java</span><span>Node.js</span>
      <span>Web Developer</span><span>Front-end</span><span>Three.js</span><span>Glassmorphism</span><span>Scroll Effects</span><span>Java</span><span>Node.js</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="blk" id="about">
    <div class="wrap about">
      <div class="txt">
        <div class="sec-lab rv"><span class="mono">002 — Who I Am</span></div>
        <h2 class="rv">Building sites that turn ideas into experiences people remember.</h2>
        <p class="rv">I'm a Computer Science student at New L.J. Institute of Engineering &amp; Technology, and I take on freelance web projects alongside my degree. I care about how a site feels: layered glass interfaces, 3D scenes, smooth scroll and layouts that stay sharp on every screen.</p>
        <p class="rv">Class gives me the fundamentals in Java, data structures and algorithms. Right now I'm learning Node.js, Express and MySQL so I can build the backend as well as the front end.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stats rv">
        <div class="stat"><b>8.92</b><span class="mono">CPI · B.E. CS</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><b>2028</b><span class="mono">Batch</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><b>3</b><span class="mono">Featured projects</span></div>
